  m_text: "Level 2 \n\nThe infection is spreading and the enemy waves are growing
    stronger. Keep moving, collect weapon pickups, and defeat enemies to gain upgrades.\n\nAfter
    some time, a powerful Rat Boss will appear. Watch out for the toxic swamp pools
    it creates.\n\nSurvive the encounter and hold out until the timer ends."
